This is a significant and exciting architectural shift. Moving from a simple Maker-Checker to a multi-level state machine requires careful orchestration, especially with dynamic scheduling and role-based routing.
Since you want to tackle **Manual Entry** first, we will lay the foundation by creating the new Entities, Repositories, updating the DTOs to accept scheduling, and finally modifying your createBatchRequest method to initialize this new workflow.
Here is the step-by-step guide to wire up the creation phase of the new workflow.
### Step 1: Create the New Models
